<title>INDIA: India inflation rate unchanged at 7.78 pct in week.</title>
<headline>India inflation rate unchanged at 7.78 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index stood at 7.78 percent in the week ending March 8, unchanged from the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Mar 8, 1997  Mar 1, 1997   Mar 10, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.78	   +7.78	   +5.17</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  322.6	   322.7	   299.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended March 10, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
